Package: simevent
Title: Simulation and Analysis of Event History Data
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Michaela", family = "Lukacova", email = "michaela.lukacova@sund.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Bjarke", family = "Hautop Kristensen", email = "bjarke.kristensen@sund.ku.dk", role = "aut"),
    person("Helene", "Charlotte Wiese Rytgaard", email = "hely@sund.ku.dk", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Simulate continuous-time event history data, such as treatment
    decisions, disease progression and death, from a model of baseline
    covariates, time-varying covariates and event processes linked by Cox-type
    effects. Processes may be censoring, terminal or recurrent, with Weibull or
    user-supplied cumulative baseline hazards, and models can also be built from
    fitted Cox models to simulate data resembling observed data. Interventions
    on covariates and processes can be simulated and their effect on event
    risks evaluated.
